# Generated blocks of stage texts (Ola SSE S1 fase GZ; Tools/ShaderTranscription/common/glslgz.py): <block>.glsl.gz is binary (one
# GZip member per class) and is shown as its text by the diff driver glslgz (textconv = gzip -dc), versioned in glslgz.gitconfig and
# turned on once per clone with:  git config --local include.path ../glslgz.gitconfig
# <block>.glsl.idx is ASCII written with LF by the generator and read byte for byte by GlslBlockStore: no end-of-line conversion.
# Both are checked by gate G0 (each generator's --check) and by ParityGate glsl-blockstore.
*.glsl.gz binary diff=glslgz
*.glsl.idx -text
